Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- the default desktop picture.
;
; Our own art, generated at package build by theme/wallpapers/gen-wallpaper.py
; (panes of coloured glass in lead) and installed in
; /usr/share/stained-glass/wallpapers, reached through Wine's Z: drive.
; WallpaperStyle 10 is Fill, as Windows 10's default; wine-sg patch 0069 makes
; the desktop draw JPEGs and honour the style.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Control Panel\Desktop]
"Wallpaper"="Z:\\usr\\share\\stained-glass\\wallpapers\\stained-glass.jpg"
"WallpaperStyle"="10"
"TileWallpaper"="0"
